{"articleNo":"372314","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=372314&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 대동제 체육대회 참가자 공결처리 관련 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.31","hit":"10801","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">대동제 체육대회 예선 참가로&nbsp;인한 공결신청 관련 안내드립니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">공결신청은&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">총학생회에서 대상자 명단 및 수업목록&nbsp;수합 완료 후&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">학생성공처로 제출되었으며</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">학생성공처에서는 해당 자료를 검토하여 교무처로&nbsp;공결승인 요청 후 승인 처리 순서로 진행됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">참가자 수가 많아&nbsp;순차로 진행되며, 현재 1차 요청분에 대하여 입력 완료되었으며,</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">완료된 대상자에게는 지난주 금오톡톡 안내하였으므로 톡톡 알림을 받은 학생들은 본인의 승인내역을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2차 공결신청분 정리까지&nbsp;완료되면 학생성공처에서 교무처로 요청할 예정입니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">교무처에서 2차 신청의 승인처리가 완료되면 역시 대상자에게 금오톡톡 알림예정이니</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">마찬가지로 톡톡 알림을 받은 학생들은 본인의 승인내역을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">신청 누락여부 및 진행상황 문의</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">학생성공처 054-478-7040</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">감사합니다.</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: 굴림; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
